                <mxCell id="35" value="&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(8, 8, 8); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, freesans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;Сервис бронирования получает запрос,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 8, 8); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, freesans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(8, 8, 8); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, freesans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;сохраняет бронь комнаты в своей БД&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 8, 8); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, freesans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(8, 8, 8); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, freesans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;и должен отправить запрос на оплату в платёжный сервис.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 8, 8); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, freesans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(8, 8, 8); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, freesans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;Сервисы могут падать,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 8, 8); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, freesans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(8, 8, 8); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, freesans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;сеть может быть недоступна,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 8, 8); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, freesans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(8, 8, 8); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, freesans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;а ответ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 8, 8); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, freesans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(8, 8, 8); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, freesans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;—&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 8, 8); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, freesans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(8, 8, 8); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, freesans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;потеряться.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 8, 8); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, freesans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(8, 8, 8); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, freesans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;Как не потерять запрос на оплату и не списать деньги дважды при повторной попытке?&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
